/TU (The RL framework integrates the AnyLogic model with a Python-based RL experiment class. In the Python environment, agent behaviour entities perform actions for the RL experiment and receive observations from it. These entities, along with the RL experiment from AnyLogic, are linked to a neural network policy through additional Python interfaces.)
